{
    "background_story": "Ximena's life took a drastic turn when her husband passed away, leaving her with nothing but debt and two young children to care for. Despite her best efforts, she found herself on the streets, forced to beg for scraps to feed her family. As a beggarwoman, Ximena's days were filled with rejection and humiliation, but she refused to give up. She would often sing softly to herself, a melancholic tune that echoed through the alleys. One day, a kind-hearted musician stumbled upon her singing and was struck by her haunting voice. He offered to help her get back on her feet, and soon Ximena's talent was discovered by the community. She began performing on street corners, earning enough to feed her children and eventually rebuild her life. Though her circumstances had reduced her to begging, Ximena's spirit and talent ultimately lifted her out of poverty and into a brighter future.",
